title: Enable speculative messaging on Penpal
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Penpal supports sibling XCM over speculative messaging and targets three parachain
    blocks per relay block with a relay-parent offset of one. Emulated tests compare
    XCM behavior over speculative messaging and HRMP.

    The XCM emulator adds an optional `AdditionalInherentCode::on_finalize_block` hook
    for reading the block’s writes after pallet finalization.
crates:
- name: penpal-runtime
  bump: major
- name: xcm-emulator
  bump: minor
